Honestly, the in-process Go test is the cleanest way to demonstrate. Let me write a quick throwaway Go test (not committed... or maybe committed as a regression test? The task doesn't ask for tests, but a regression test is good practice. The repo has extensive test files. Adding a concurrency regression test would fit the repo style).

